ul cars and master the perfect drift as you slide through tight corners with precision and style.\n\nFeel realistic driving physics with responsive controls that make every turn and drift feel smooth and satisfying. Balance speed and control as you push your limits and improve your drifting skills in immersive VR gameplay.\n\nChallenge yourself across different tracks, sharpen your techniques, and aim for perfect drifts. Every run tests your timing, control, and ability to handle intense driving situations.\n\n**Features:**\n- Realistic drift physics\n- Smooth driving controls\n- High-speed gameplay\n- Immersive VR racing\n- Skill-based drifting\n- Challenging tracks\n\nWhether you're a beginner or a drifting pro, Car Drifting VR delivers an exciting and addictive driving experience. Start your engine and drift like a champion! \ud83d\ude97\ud83d\udca8", "short_description": "Burn rubber in Car Drifting VR and master the art of drifting! Slide through sharp turns, control high-speed cars, and dominate challenging tracks. Experience realistic driving physics, smooth controls, and thrilling drift action in one of the most exciting car drifting VR games."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/prism-horizon/privacy-policy-prismhorizons", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Prism Horizon", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/prism-horizon/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_T